## 9. Options / DTOs

### 9.1 MessageRef

```
type MessageRef struct {
  ChatID    int64
  MessageID int64
}
```

### 9.2 InputFile

v0.1 定义 3 种来源：

```
type InputFile struct {
  // Exactly one should be set
  FileID   string // Telegram file_id
  URL      string // http(s) url
  LocalPath string // local file path (implementation decides how to open)
}
```

### 9.3 SendOption / EditOption / AnswerOption

v0.1 只定义常用字段，未来可扩展（保持向后兼容）。

```
type SendOption struct {
  ParseMode   string // "MarkdownV2" / "HTML" / ""
  DisablePreview bool
  ReplyToMessageID int64
  ReplyMarkup any // inline keyboard, etc (kept as any to avoid SDK lock-in)
}

type EditOption struct {
  ParseMode string
  ReplyMarkup any
}

type AnswerOption struct {
  ShowAlert bool
}
```

